# Operator names are case-sensitive: `Take` is DS0104 with a fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv' | Take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..22
  PIPELINE@0..21
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    TAKE_OP@15..21
      IDENT@15..19 "Take"
      WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
      LITERAL@20..21
        LONG@20..21 "5"
  WHITESPACE@21..22 "\n"

error[DS0104]: unknown operator `Take`
  --> query:1:16
  |
1 | 'orders.csv' | Take 5
  |                ^^^^ operator names are case-sensitive
  |
  = help: write `take`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv' | take 5
which parses without errors
